<v Ira Glass>[赞助信息]

00:58:04.260 --> 00:58:09.950
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia who insists, insists, insists--
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ管理监督由托里·马拉蒂亚负责，他坚持、坚持、坚持——

00:58:09.950 --> 00:58:12.480
<v David Sedaris>It wasn't mine.
<v David Sedaris>这不是我的。

00:58:12.480 --> 00:58:17.480
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life .
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。
